Third-party notices for Local Reader
====================================

Local Reader's own source code is MIT-licensed (see LICENSE). It depends on the
projects below. Model weights and SDK checkouts are downloaded at setup or
build time; they are not distributed in this repository. Check each upstream
project for its current license and attribution requirements.

Speech models and SDKs
----------------------

Kokoro-82M, by hexgrad: Apache License 2.0
  https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  Used through the MLX conversion https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Kokoro-82M-bf16

kokoro-mlx, by Soroush Yousefpour: MIT License (reproduced below)
  https://pypi.org/project/kokoro-mlx/
  server/speech.py adapts part of kokoro-mlx 0.1.2's model forward pass to keep
  phoneme durations for word timing.

Pocket TTS, by Kyutai: model weights under CC BY 4.0
  https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts
  Mac: English 2026-04 preset-voice weights from
  https://huggingface.co/kyutai/pocket-tts-without-voice-cloning
  iPhone: Core ML conversion by FluidInference,
  https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/pocket-tts-coreml

FluidAudio, by FluidInference: Apache License 2.0
  https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio
  Checked out at a pinned revision by ios/prepare.sh.

